    ],
    "text": "THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      369.89,
      286.55,
      449.02
    ],
    "text": "Reference No. : Maha/L/Ac/345. I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.0199999809265137,
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.16,
      449.53,
      226.57,
      466.5
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      472.51,
      289.01,
      552.6
    ],
    "text": "Allotments of land in extent of about 0.0092 Hectare, depicted as Lot No. 01 in the Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9518 was prepared by the surveyor General of Colombo, District, situated in the village of Malapalla, In the Minor Division of Palle Paththuwa, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Maharagama, in the Colombo District in Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      553.03,
      286.46,
      601.5
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Galabadawatta; Description: Garden; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: H. P.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      330.25,
      539.46,
      352.8
    ],
    "text": "Amarasena, No. 17/18, Ekwatta Road, Mirihana, Nugegoda; Extent: 0.0092 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      369.31,
      539.5,
      495.42
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretary\u2019s, Office of Maharagama on the 29th day of April , 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 22nd day of April, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      495.78,
      539.45,
      551.84
    ],
